evals/**/????????-????-????-????-????????????/
# Claude Code's folder at the repository root. It holds a maintainer's local notes
# (.claude/CLAUDE.md, which imports docs/maintainers.md), a local copy of the handoff records
# (.claude/handoff/), worktrees (.claude/worktrees/) and session state. None of it is committed:
# every committed file ships with the plugin, and Claude Code can load these files as project
# memory in a user's session (D39). validate.mjs refuses any tracked path under .claude/.
# Status notes and handoff records live on the maintainer-notes branch. .claude-plugin/ is
# another folder, and stays tracked.
/.claude/
# Python tooling in evals/python: uv's environment and the tools' caches
evals/python/.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
